Package: y700-software-updates
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Y700 Linux OS contributors <maintainers@localhost>
Depends: gnome-package-updater, packagekit, gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-gi, python3
Description: Touchscreen entry for Debian software updates on the Y700
 Refresh the configured package indexes through PackageKit and choose updates
 with Debian's GTK package updater in the Xfce desktop.
